### Solution:
```php
Route::get('/v1/transform', function(Request $request) {
    $operation = $request->input('operation');
    $transforms = Transform::all();

    $transformedData = $transforms->map(function ($transform) use ($operation) {
        switch ($operation) {
            case 'uppercase':
                return strtoupper($transform->data);
            case 'lowercase':
                return strtolower($transform->data);
            case 'reverse':
